{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:86ae42c224fc1582","name":"Trandosha","source":{"id":"source:reference-86ae42c224fc1582","title":"Trandosha","revision":18572,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:20:26Z","sha256":"20f2f461b90a21d58c7200d3725393c621388e2c6d108aa504324c13d6150b23","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18572","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Trandosha&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-86ae42c224fc1582","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Region:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Mid Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Mid_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Climate:"]}," Arid\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gravity","referenceId":"reference:19602d23667cf93d"},":"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low_Gravity"}," (62% Standard)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Moons:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Length of Day:"]}," 25 Standard Hours\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Length of Year:"]}," 371 Local Days\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Sapient Species:"]}," 99% ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," (Native), 1% Other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Population:"]}," 42 Million\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Government:"]}," Tribal\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Capital:"]}," Hsskhor\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Major Exports:"]}," Slaves, Mercenaries\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Major Imports:"]}," Technology\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Galactic Lore"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RESULT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Trandosha is located in the same system as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," homeworld. The two Species rarely see eye to eye.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Trandosha boasts lighter than average gravity, which allows the sluggish ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"}," to move with ease on their homeworld.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Trandosha joined the galactic community many millennia ago, but has always been indirectly represented in galactic affairs by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," representative, which has led to some amnesty between the two Species.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Social Sciences"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["RESULT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"}," make poor diplomats and have trouble dealing peacefully with others.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," slavers have captured or killed more ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," than any other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"}," revere their tribal elders. Breaking ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," traditions or disrespecting one's elders often leads to exile from individual cities or even the entire planet.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Planetary Updates"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["The Old Republic Era"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["By the time of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},", Trandosha has been a part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," for several centuries, though it has not integrated itself into the Republic as thoroughly as other planets. In fact, though the world has representation in the Galactic Senate, Trandosha itself has little Republic presence. The recent discovery of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},", however, opens up new avenues to galactic prominence for Trandosha. The planet negotiates with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Czerka Corporation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Czerka_Corporation","referenceId":"reference:cf6b7a4dee7c0713"}," to gain slaving rights to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"},", beginning a millennia-long struggle between the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["The Clone Wars"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Due to its position within the Kashyyyk System, Trandosha's only representation in the Senate is Yarua, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"},". The two Species have never seen eye to eye, and their relationship is, at best, lukewarm at the outbreak of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," due to a number of factors. Peaceful negotiations between the two Species had never been completely successful. Shortly before the outbreak of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", diplomacy completely breaks down when a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," ship is attacked over one of Trandosha's moons. In response, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," erect a blockade around Trandosha. Peace talks rekindle the following year, but these fail when the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," learn that the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"}," are seeking Senatorial backing with the aid of the Trade Federation.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though never committed to the Separatist cause in a public forum, a number of independent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," organizations join forces with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"}," during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},". Pirate bands, slavers, and pro-",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshan","referenceId":"reference:7462eb9a66c70e5d"}," terrorist groups participate in many Separatist actions, particularly those that take place on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," homeworld prior to the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},". In truth, many (if not most) of these groups have indirect financial backing from Trandosha itself, as the planetary government is only too happy to direct its own attacks upon the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," from the shadows.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["The Legacy Era"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["With the blockade of neighboring ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},", Trandosha has become the new influential power in the Kashyyyk System. Unlike the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"}," have shown no penchant for causing strife with the Empire, and the planet has been rewarded for it. Most of the commerce that once went through ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"}," is now flowing through Trandosha, giving the natives a much-needed economic boast. With the influx of credits, Trandosha is taking great steps to upgrade its cities and technology. The government of Trandosha is hoping that, with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"}," out of the picture, their world will finally become a major power in the galaxy. New money also means new weapons and new Starships, and thanks to favorable deals with the Empire, Trandosha has become a significant military power.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}," has granted Trandosha the authority to patrol its star system for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," who have violated the blockade on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kashyyyk"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kashyyyk","referenceId":"reference:0886d73261c13472"},", with the authority to use lethal force on any suspected ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," smugglers. Furthermore, since the rise of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Krayt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Krayt","referenceId":"reference:c6d0b6bc88280f92"},", Trandosha has become a primary trade hub for nearby inhabited systems, forcing planets like ",{"tag":"a","children":["Boz Pity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Boz_Pity?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sriluur"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sriluur","referenceId":"reference:7f6660ec1ad7b615"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Togoria"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Togoria?action=edit&redlink=1"}," to deal with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"}," or pay exorbitant prices to have trade goods shipped from other regions. Trandosha is a world receiving a quick influx of credits and power, and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trandoshans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trandoshans"}," are using that power to bully neighboring worlds, all with the endorsement of the Empire. Trandosha's bullying is hardly restricted to nearby systems, either; the planet has begun making threats against worlds as far away as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hapes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hapes?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Manaan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Manaan","referenceId":"reference:e148d0a9b917e831"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nal Hutta"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nal_Hutta?action=edit&redlink=1"},", attempting to force those worlds to bow to their will or face the Trandoshans' wrath.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
